sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GoHTTP as Go Feature Server<br/>HTTP Handler
    participant GoGRPC as Go Feature Server<br/>gRPC ServingService
    participant PyServer as Python Feature Server<br/>FastAPI :6566
    participant SecMgr as SecurityManager<br/>AuthManager
    participant OIDC as OIDC Provider
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>:6443 HTTPS
    participant OnlineStore as Online Store<br/>PostgreSQL / Redis / Valkey
    participant Registry as Registry<br/>S3 / GCS
    participant Operator as Feast Operator<br/>FeatureStoreReconciler

    Note over Client, Registry: Flow 1: Online Feature Retrieval (Go - No Auth)
    Client->>GoHTTP: POST /get-online-features<br/>HTTP, Configurable TLS
    GoHTTP->>Registry: Load feature metadata<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Cloud IAM
    Registry-->>GoHTTP: Feature definitions
    GoHTTP->>OnlineStore: Query feature values<br/>TCP, Configured encryption
    OnlineStore-->>GoHTTP: Feature values
    GoHTTP-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client, Registry: Flow 1b: Online Feature Retrieval (Go gRPC)
    Client->>GoGRPC: GetOnlineFeatures<br/>gRPC HTTP/2, No auth interceptor
    GoGRPC->>OnlineStore: Query feature values<br/>TCP, Configured encryption
    OnlineStore-->>GoGRPC: Feature values
    GoGRPC-->>Client: gRPC Response

    Note over Client, Registry: Flow 2: Python Feature Server (Authenticated)
    Client->>PyServer: POST /get-online-features<br/>HTTP/HTTPS :6566, Configurable TLS
    PyServer->>SecMgr: Validate request
    alt OIDC Auth Mode
        SecMgr->>OIDC: Validate JWT token<br/>HTTPS, TLS
        OIDC-->>SecMgr: Token claims
    else Kubernetes RBAC Mode
        SecMgr->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS :6443, TLS 1.2+
        K8sAPI-->>SecMgr: Authorization decision
    else No Auth Mode
        SecMgr-->>SecMgr: AllowAll (pass-through)
    end
    SecMgr-->>PyServer: Auth result
    PyServer->>OnlineStore: Query feature values<br/>TCP, Configured encryption
    OnlineStore-->>PyServer: Feature values
    PyServer-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Operator, K8sAPI: Flow 3: Operator Reconciliation
    K8sAPI->>Operator: FeatureStore CR change event<br/>Watch, TLS, ServiceAccount
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployments<br/>HTTPS :6443, TLS 1.2+, SA token
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Services<br/>HTTPS :6443, TLS 1.2+, SA token
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ConfigMaps<br/>HTTPS :6443, TLS 1.2+, SA token
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update RBAC resources<br/>HTTPS :6443, TLS 1.2+, SA token
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HPAs, PDBs, CronJobs<br/>HTTPS :6443, TLS 1.2+, SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Resource status updates
